<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wöchentlicher Verkaufsbericht - KW {{weekNumber}} {{year}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #28a745;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-box {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #28a745;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .kpi-number {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #28a745;
        }
        .kpi-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .comparison {
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .positive { color: #28a745; }
        .negative { color: #dc3545; }
        .neutral { color: #6c757d; }
        .table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background-color: white;
        }
        .table th,
        .table td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .table th {
            background-color: #28a745;
            color: white;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: #d4edda !important;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .daily-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .day-box {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        }
        .day-box.best {
            background-color: #d4edda;
            border-color: #28a745;
        }
        .day-box.worst {
            background-color: #f8d7da;
            border-color: #dc3545;
        }
        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #28a745;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>📊 Wöchentlicher Verkaufsbericht</h1>
        <p>Kalenderwoche {{weekNumber}}, {{year}} ({{formatDate startDate "DD.MM."}} - {{formatDate endDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}})</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{totalRevenue}} €</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Gesamtumsatz</div>
                <div class="comparison {{#if (gt revenueChange 0)}}positive{{else if (lt revenueChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt revenueChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{revenueChange}}% vs. Vorwoche
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{totalTransactions}}</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Transaktionen</div>
                <div class="comparison {{#if (gt transactionChange 0)}}positive{{else if (lt transactionChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt transactionChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{transactionChange}}% vs. Vorwoche
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{averageTransaction}} €</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Ø Transaktionswert</div>
                <div class="comparison {{#if (gt avgTransactionChange 0)}}positive{{else if (lt avgTransactionChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt avgTransactionChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{avgTransactionChange}}% vs. Vorwoche
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{dailyAverage}} €</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Ø Tagesumsatz</div>
                <div class="comparison neutral">
                    {{workingDays}} Verkaufstage
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{margin}}%</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Durchschnittsmarge</div>
                <div class="comparison {{#if (gt marginChange 0)}}positive{{else if (lt marginChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt marginChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{marginChange}}% vs. Vorwoche
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📅 Tägliche Verkaufsentwicklung</h3>
            <div class="daily-grid">
                {{#each dailyData}}
                <div class="day-box {{#if isBest}}best{{else if isWorst}}worst{{/if}}">
                    <div style="font-weight: bold;">{{dayName}}</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">{{formatDate date "DD.MM."}}</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #28a745; margin: 5px 0;">{{revenue}} €</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 12px;">{{transactions}} Trans.</div>
                </div>
                {{/each}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🏆 Top 10 Standorte nach Umsatz</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Rang</th>
                        <th>Standort</th>
                        <th>Wochenumsatz</th>
                        <th>Ø Tagesumsatz</th>
                        <th>Transaktionen</th>
                        <th>Ø Wert</th>
                        <th>Trend</th>
                        <th>Vorwoche</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each topLocations}}
                    <tr {{#if (lte @index 2)}}class="highlight"{{/if}}>
                        <td>{{add @index 1}}</td>
                        <td>{{locationName}}</td>
                        <td>{{weeklyRevenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{dailyAverage}} €</td>
                        <td>{{transactions}}</td>
                        <td>{{averageValue}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt changePercent 0)}}positive{{else if (lt changePercent 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt changePercent 0)}}📈 +{{changePercent}}%{{else if (lt changePercent 0)}}📉 {{changePercent}}%{{else}}➡️ 0%{{/if}}
                        </td>
                        <td>{{previousWeek}} €</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🥇 Top 10 Produkte nach Verkaufsmenge</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Rang</th>
                        <th>Produkt</th>
                        <th>Verkaufte Menge</th>
                        <th>Wochenumsatz</th>
                        <th>Ø Preis</th>
                        <th>Standorte</th>
                        <th>Marktanteil</th>
                        <th>Trend</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each topProducts}}
                    <tr {{#if (lte @index 2)}}class="highlight"{{/if}}>
                        <td>{{add @index 1}}</td>
                        <td>{{productName}}</td>
                        <td>{{quantity}} Stk.</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{averagePrice}} €</td>
                        <td>{{locations}}</td>
                        <td>{{marketShare}}%</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt trend 0)}}positive{{else if (lt trend 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt trend 0)}}📈{{else if (lt trend 0)}}📉{{else}}➡️{{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📊 Kategorien-Performance</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Kategorie</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Anteil</th>
                        <th>Menge</th>
                        <th>Ø Preis</th>
                        <th>Veränderung</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each categories}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{categoryName}}</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>
                            {{percentage}}%
                            <div class="progress-bar">
                                <div class="progress-fill" style="width: {{percentage}}%;"></div>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td>{{quantity}} Stk.</td>
                        <td>{{averagePrice}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt change 0)}}positive{{else if (lt change 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt change 0)}}+{{/if}}{{change}}%
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>⏰ Verkäufe nach Wochentagen</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Wochentag</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Anteil</th>
                        <th>Transaktionen</th>
                        <th>Ø Wert</th>
                        <th>vs. Vorwoche</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each weekdayData}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{dayName}}</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{percentage}}%</td>
                        <td>{{transactions}}</td>
                        <td>{{averageValue}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt change 0)}}positive{{else if (lt change 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt change 0)}}+{{/if}}{{change}}%
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        {{#if insights}}
        <div class="section" style="border-left: 4px solid #17a2b8;">
            <h3>💡 Wöchentliche Erkenntnisse</h3>
            <ul>
                {{#each insights}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if recommendations}}
        <div class="section" style="border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;">
            <h3>📋 Empfehlungen für nächste Woche</h3>
            <ul>
                {{#each recommendations}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📈 Monatliche Entwicklung (letzten 4 Wochen)</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Kalenderwoche</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Transaktionen</th>
                        <th>Ø Wert</th>
                        <th>Veränderung</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each monthlyData}}
                    <tr {{#if isCurrent}}class="highlight"{{/if}}>
                        <td>KW {{weekNumber}}</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{transactions}}</td>
                        <td>{{averageValue}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt change 0)}}positive{{else if (lt change 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt change 0)}}+{{/if}}{{change}}%
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Dieser Bericht wurde automatisch vom Proviantomat-System generiert.</p>
        <p>Berichtszeitraum: KW {{weekNumber}} {{year}} ({{formatDate startDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}} - {{formatDate endDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}})</p>
        <p>Generiert am: {{formatDate sentAt "DD.MM.YYYY HH:mm"}} (Europe/Berlin)</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>